  "daily_overview": "科技领域，GPT-6 Astra 震撼发布，重新定义了计算机控制与编码生产力，同时国产异构算力展现高性价比优势。金融市场方面，随着伊朗局势引发油价震荡，资本市场正密切关注通胀风险及能源供应链波动，Anthropic 筹备上市成为关注焦点。地缘政治上，美伊对抗持续，欧洲面临潜在破坏行动，全球避险情绪有所升温。\n\nIn technology, the launch of GPT-6 Astra redefines computer-use and coding productivity, while domestic heterogeneous computing solutions show high cost-effectiveness. In finance, rising geopolitical tensions between the US and Iran have stirred oil markets, focusing attention on inflation risks and supply chain vulnerabilities, with Anthropic's IPO preparations gathering momentum. Geopolitically, the US-Iran standoff intensifies, and Europe faces a spiral of sabotage, heightening global risk aversion.",
